{#-
  index.html.j2: the list page (Milestone 2 step 3). Server-rendered in the default rank's
  order, Projects (M2-D1, amended 2026-09-30), so the page works without JavaScript;
  the script then filters and reorders these rows. Context:
  site/CONTRACT.md, "Templates" (every page's context plus `list`). The list itself, filters
  included, is in _list.html.j2 so a later /check/ page can include it unchanged.

  The page stops after the lead (owner's site rulings of 2026-10-07): the note "Why isn't my
  favorite free font here?" is on the About page (why_not_listed_to_about), and the privacy
  line is in every page's footer (privacy_line_in_footer). On phones the heading is smaller
  and the lead shows its first sentence only; the second stays in the page for screen readers
  (mobile_first_screen_two_fonts, 2026-10-06; 20-list.css).
-#}
{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block head %}
<link rel="preload" href="{{ list.index_url }}" as="fetch" crossorigin>
{% endblock %}
{% block main %}
<h1 class="list-title">The most popular purely free fonts</h1>
{# The lead's second sentence: the owner's wording of 2026-10-05 (front_page_lead_counts), landing with the Project default. #}
<p class="lead">Every font here is free for any personal or commercial use, and you may share the files. <span class="visually-hidden-phone">They are ranked by public counts of use in websites, code and apps.</span></p>
{% include "_list.html.j2" %}
{% endblock %}
